  "title": "India-Uzbekistan and India-Japan Strategic Partnerships and Quad Cooperation Deepen",
  "summary": "India's Defence Minister reiterated India's commitment to sharing its 'battle-tested' anti-terror expertise with Asean and ASEAN Defence Ministers, while Prime Minister Narendra Modi and President Shavkat Mirziyoyev of Uzbekistan strengthened trade, defense, and energy cooperation. India also expanded its involvement in the Brics, and the Quad foreign ministers reaffirmed their commitment to building reliable and open global supply chains and trusted infrastructure.",
